 .../GraphicsPipeline/DepthOfField.cpp         | 82 ++++++++++++-------
 .../Module/CinematicCameraComponent.h         | 18 ++--
 Code/CryPlugins/CinematicCamera/README.md     | 28 +++++--
 .../CinematicCamera/docs/ConsoleReference.md  | 13 +--
 5 files changed, 99 insertions(+), 55 deletions(-)

