 Not overwritten by the plugin; tune it from the console at any time. Blade Curvature feeds the
-same exponent: straight blades (curvature 0) stay fully formed at every aperture instead of
-following the f/1.2 - f/2.8 window. Curvature's other half is the polygon's **edge softness**
-in the splat (0.06 pupil-radius units when fully curved, 0.015 when fully straight), which is
